{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110627","id":2837594788,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6pIkKk","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110627","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110627.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110627.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110627","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110627/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110627/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110627/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fc951855ed7b551410bf3f7d293f8a164a5c71e2","number":110627,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Move check for sky cubemap array back into the SkyRD initializer","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110589\r\nRegression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103306\r\n\r\nThis basically removes the changes from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105424\r\n\r\nWe need to disable `sky_use_cubemap_array` as early as possible since it can be read from a few places during initialization of the renderer. However, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103306 caused a crash because it used `RenderingServer::get_singleton()->get_video_adapter_name()` which isn't available until after the `Utilities` class is initialized. However, `Utilities::get_video_adapter_name()` is just a wrapper function for `RenderingDevice::get_device_name()`. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8b4b93a82e13cb1b7ea5fa28b39163a6311a0bb3/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/utilities.cpp#L313-L315\r\n\r\nSo there is no need to access `Utilities` at all. \r\n\r\nIn https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105424 we moved the check until the end of `RendererCompositorRD::initialize()` to ensure the RenderingServer was initialized. That fixed the crash, but it caused the graphical artifacts in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110589 because `sky_use_cubemap_array` was getting set to false _after_ it had been read during initialization. So all our shaders were compiled thinking that `sky_use_cubemap_array` was true, but then at run time we followed the false path. This is why setting the project setting for `sky_use_cubemap_array` to false made the graphical artifacts go away. \r\n\r\nSince we don't need to rely on `RenderingServer::get_singleton()->get_video_adapter_name()` after all. We can move the check up to `SkyRD()` to ensure that it is done on time. Now the code is simpler, more self contained and doesn't cause a crash. ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo